Package: pmrmPlus
Type: Package
Title: Extended Progression Models for Repeated Measures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mukul", "Bijalwan", email = "mukulbijalwan555@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3040-6912")),
    person("Gunjan", "Aggrwal", role = "aut"),
    person("Mukul", "Jain", role = "aut"))
Description: Extended progression models for repeated measures in progressive
    disease clinical trials. Provides nonlinear mixed-effects progression
    models (linear, plateau, Emax, exponential decay), delayed treatment
    onset estimation by profile likelihood, joint longitudinal-survival
    models for informative dropout, competing-risks extensions,
    biomarker-informed adaptive dosing rules, and simulation-based power
    and sample-size calculation.
